@startuml
[*] --> Idle
Idle --> AmountSelection : User initiates withdrawal
AmountSelection --> PredefinedAmountSelection : User selects predefined amount
AmountSelection --> CustomAmountInput : User enters custom amount
PredefinedAmountSelection --> Processing : Amount selected
CustomAmountInput --> Processing : Amount entered
Processing --> Idle : User cancels transaction
Processing --> CardEjection : Sufficient funds available
CardEjection --> [*] : Transaction complete

